["TEXT","e242",160,470,0,"Current is regulated by MAXM86146 LED drivers. Set pulse current / timing before acquisition.","small",0]
["TEXT","e243",160,446,0,"CB=0: LED2 -> RED, LED3 -> IR. CB=1: LED2 -> GREEN1, LED3 -> GREEN2.","small",0]
["TEXT","e244",160,422,0,"GREEN1 cathode is also connected to LED1_DRV, following the ADI typical application.","small",0]
["TEXT","e245",160,398,0,"Keep the GREEN1 shared path: three independent LEDs would change the reference design.","small",0]
["TEXT","e246",160,374,0,"MAX14689 VCC=1.8 V; analog terminals support beyond-rail signals within its ratings.","small",0]
["TEXT","e247",160,350,0,"Green LED: physical pad 1 = anode; pads 2 and 3 = cathode. Both cathode pads are wired.","small",0]
["TEXT","e248",160,326,0,"Before PCB: audit emitter land patterns, optical separation, black barriers and skin contact geometry.","small",0]
["TEXT","e249",160,302,0,"Heart rate / SpO2 algorithms, calibration, motion rejection and human testing remain required.","small",0]
